# CGP — environment configuration
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. These are PUBLISHABLE values (safe in a
# client app).

# Base URL of the CGP pass-signing service. When set, "Add to Apple Wallet" /
# "Save to Google Wallet" open a real signed pass (the Apple pass certificate
# and Google Wallet issuer key live on that server, never in the app).
VITE_WALLET_ENDPOINT=
